      <p class="_abstract">You can disable the custom resource definition (CRD) upgrade safety preflight check. In the <code>ClusterExtension</code> object that provides the CRD, set the <code>install.preflight.crdUpgradeSafety.enforcement</code> field with the value of <code>None</code>.</p>
      <Alert variant="warning" class="my-4">
